<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00160/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一正常尺寸黑色U盘，容量64G，必须在翻转三次或以上后才能插入USB接口，无论在视觉上接口与U盘是否匹配。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>陕西省██市一电子产品专卖店内，经检查其余商品无异常性质。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>由研究员李██持有<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>买到它时我差点弄坏了电脑接口。——研究员李██</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00160" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00160" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00160-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leaven" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5979701); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5979701&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609857413" alt="LEAVEN" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5979701)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leaven" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5979701); return false;">LEAVEN</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1588772366 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">06 May 2020 13:39</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00374/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<strong>项目描述：</strong>一件男士休闲衬衫。<br />
<span style="color: #bb0000">A.展开更多</span> <span style="color: #bb0000">B.展开更多</span>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">C.展开更多</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">C.点我隐藏</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>项目具有认知危害和信息危害，人类将项目穿上、认知项目以及描述项目的行为均会使自身受到精神影响，具体表现为在需要做出有3个以上选项的抉择时，将会明显地倾向于选择第3个选项。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>被Dr.Coldmist于██服饰店以£9.15的价格购得。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>收容于Site-CN-██低价值物品收容柜。</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00374" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00374" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00374-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/coldmist" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6439634); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6439634&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609857413" alt="Coldmist" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6439634)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/coldmist" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6439634); return false;">Coldmist</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1598068525 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">22 Aug 2020 03:55</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00111/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一张████餐馆的菜单，任何人类在观察项目时，项目上的菜品都会变成此人最喜欢吃的东西，当有人在菜品后的方框中打勾时，此人的面前就会出现刚刚勾选的菜品<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>上海市████餐馆中<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放置于site—██的食堂中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>嘿，终于不用忍受食堂那可怕的饭菜了！</em>——Dr.pigeon</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+实验记录</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;实验记录1</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>当使用机器人在菜单上勾选时，会在空中出现一行字：“机器人不用吃饭”语言随观察者而变化</p>
